{"resource":{"id":"go-complete-tutorial","title":"Go — Complete Tutorial","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"55 min","pages":89,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Programming","Go","Concurrency"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"The complete Go tutorial — from language basics to concurrent backends, REST APIs, databases, testing, and production deployment."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Introduction"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Installation"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Variables"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Data Types"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Functions"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Methods"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Structs"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Interfaces"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Packages"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Modules"},{"id":"s11","label":"11. Error Handling"},{"id":"s12","label":"12. File Handling"},{"id":"s13","label":"13. JSON"},{"id":"s14","label":"14. Goroutines"},{"id":"s15","label":"15. Channels"},{"id":"s16","label":"16. Mutexes"},{"id":"s17","label":"17. Context Package"},{"id":"s18","label":"18. HTTP Server"},{"id":"s19","label":"19. REST API"},{"id":"s20","label":"20. Database Integration"},{"id":"s21","label":"21. Testing"},{"id":"s22","label":"22. Performance"},{"id":"s23","label":"23. Deployment"},{"id":"s24","label":"24. Capstone Project"},{"id":"review","label":"Complete Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Go — Beginner Guide","tag":"Programming","time":"17 min"},{"title":"Go — PDF Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"52 min"},{"title":"Go — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Programming","time":"5 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Master idiomatic Go from syntax to advanced concurrency.</li>\n          <li>Build a production-ready HTTP service backed by a real database.</li>\n          <li>Write robust tests, benchmarks, and race-checked concurrent code.</li>\n          <li>Ship a capstone project as a container image.</li>\n          <li>Prepare confidently for Go backend interviews.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Go was designed for building large, reliable, and scalable server software. It compiles to a single static binary, has a garbage collector, and puts concurrency at the centre of the language via goroutines and channels.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Go's design targets networked backends: static binaries, fast startup, and cheap concurrency.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Installation</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code># macOS\nbrew install go\n# Linux\ncurl -LO https://go.dev/dl/go1.22.linux-amd64.tar.gz &amp;&amp; sudo tar -C /usr/local -xzf go1.22.linux-amd64.tar.gz\nexport PATH=$PATH:/usr/local/go/bin\ngo version</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Variables</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>var x int = 5\ny := 3.14           // inferred float64\nconst Version = &quot;1.0&quot;</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Data Types</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Numeric (<code>int</code>, <code>float64</code>), <code>string</code>, <code>bool</code>, composite (<code>array</code>, <code>slice</code>, <code>map</code>, <code>struct</code>), and reference (<code>pointer</code>, <code>chan</code>, <code>func</code>).</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Functions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>func sum(nums ...int) int {\n  total := 0\n  for _, n := range nums { total += n }\n  return total\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Methods</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type Rect struct{ W, H float64 }\nfunc (r Rect) Area() float64 { return r.W * r.H }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Structs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Compose types instead of inheriting them — Go has no classes.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type Address struct{ City string }\ntype User struct { Name string; Address }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Interfaces</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Implicit satisfaction plus small interfaces are the essence of idiomatic Go.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type Stringer interface { String() string }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Packages</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>One directory = one package. Names are lowercase, short, and meaningful. Exported identifiers start with an uppercase letter.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Modules</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>go mod init github.com/acme/api\ngo get github.com/google/uuid\ngo mod tidy</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>f, err := os.Open(&quot;data.txt&quot;)\nif err != nil { return fmt.Errorf(&quot;open: %w&quot;, err) }\ndefer f.Close()</code></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Wrap, don&#x27;t swallow</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Use <code>%w</code> when wrapping so callers can <code>errors.Is</code> / <code>errors.As</code>.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s12\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">12. File Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>data, err := os.ReadFile(&quot;config.yaml&quot;)\n_ = os.WriteFile(&quot;out.txt&quot;, data, 0o644)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s13\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">13. JSON</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type User struct { Name string \\`json:&quot;name&quot;\\` }\nb, _ := json.Marshal(User{&quot;Ada&quot;})\nvar u User; _ = json.Unmarshal(b, &amp;u)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s14\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">14. Goroutines</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Prefixing a function call with <code>go</code> runs it concurrently. Goroutines are multiplexed onto OS threads by the scheduler.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s15\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">15. Channels</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>jobs := make(chan int, 10)\nresults := make(chan int, 10)\nfor w := 0; w &lt; 3; w++ { go worker(w, jobs, results) }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s16\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">16. Mutexes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Use <code>sync.Mutex</code> when sharing memory is unavoidable. Prefer channels when possible.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s17\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">17. Context Package</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>context.Context</code> propagates deadlines, cancellation, and request values across API boundaries — always the first parameter of a long-running function.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s18\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">18. HTTP Server</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>http.HandleFunc(&quot;/ping&quot;, func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n  fmt.Fprintln(w, &quot;pong&quot;)\n})\nlog.Fatal(http.ListenAndServe(&quot;:8080&quot;, nil))</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s19\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">19. REST API</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Use <code>net/http</code> plus a lightweight router (<code>chi</code>, <code>gorilla/mux</code>, or the Go 1.22+ default mux). Return JSON and set status codes explicitly.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — A production Go service: HTTP handler → business logic → repository → database, wrapped in middleware.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s20\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">20. Database Integration</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>db, err := sql.Open(&quot;postgres&quot;, os.Getenv(&quot;DB_URL&quot;))\nrows, _ := db.QueryContext(ctx, &quot;SELECT id, name FROM users&quot;)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s21\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">21. Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>func TestAdd(t *testing.T) {\n  if add(2, 3) != 5 { t.Fatal(&quot;bad math&quot;) }\n}</code></pre></div>\n        <p>Run with <code>go test ./... -race</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s22\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">22. Performance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Benchmark with <code>testing.B</code>. Profile with <code>pprof</code>. Reduce allocations before adding parallelism.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s23\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">23. Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>FROM golang:1.22 AS build\nWORKDIR /src\nCOPY . .\nRUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /app ./cmd/api\n\nFROM gcr.io/distroless/static\nCOPY --from=build /app /app\nENTRYPOINT [&quot;/app&quot;]</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s24\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">24. Capstone Project</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Build a URL shortener: REST API, Postgres, tests, Prometheus metrics, and a Dockerfile. Deploy to any container platform.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Complete Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Final Quiz</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>What's the difference between a buffered and unbuffered channel?</li>\n          <li>When would you choose a mutex over a channel?</li>\n          <li>How does <code>context.Context</code> propagate cancellation?</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Coding Challenges</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Concurrent word count over a directory of files.</li>\n          <li>Rate limiter middleware using a token bucket.</li>\n          <li>gRPC-style JSON RPC server with graceful shutdown.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Interview Preparation</h3>\n        <p>Focus on channels, memory model, error wrapping, and how the runtime schedules goroutines.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Capstone Review</h3>\n        <p>Check: 90%+ test coverage, race detector clean, structured logging, and health/readiness probes.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is Go faster than Python?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — often 20–100× on CPU-bound workloads, and much cheaper to run concurrently.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Does Go have generics?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes, since Go 1.18 — parameterised types and functions.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which web framework should I use?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Standard <code>net/http</code> with <code>chi</code> covers 95% of services.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Race condition</strong> — non-deterministic behaviour from unsynchronised access to shared memory.</li>\n          <li><strong>Context</strong> — request-scoped cancellation and deadlines.</li>\n          <li><strong>Distroless</strong> — minimal container image with only your binary and CA certs.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          For educational purposes only. Consult go.dev, the standard library documentation,\n          and vendor docs for authoritative and up-to-date information. Trademarks belong to\n          their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}